abstract: >-
  A bilingual publication package for a user-organized independent Comparator replay
  of two formal statements at openai/math commit adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a.
  Includes execution records, axiom outputs, scope notes, secondary review and a
  bilingual essay on verification and explanation as generation becomes cheaper.
  Not an authorship claim for the upstream theorems. No fresh Lean run was performed
  during packaging.
keywords:
  - mathematical proof verification
